                </p>
                <p>
                    For entrepreneurs and startups, the automotive aerosol market represents a high-growth vertical driven by the increasing complexity of vehicle systems and the global push for DIY maintenance solutions. Understanding the intersection of formulation chemistry, mechanical engineering, and market dynamics is the first step toward building a brand that resonates with both industrial users and retail consumers. This guide serves as a technical and strategic blueprint for those looking to master the aerosol ecosystem.
                </p>
